WEBVTT

00:00:01.450 --> 00:00:05.299
<v Nuri>Look! That shell is moving across the sand.

00:00:08.449 --> 00:00:13.338
<v Nuri>Look at the legs underneath. Who is carrying the shell?

00:00:16.538 --> 00:00:22.387
<v Nuri>A hermit crab! Here is a real one. Can you point to its shell?

00:00:25.537 --> 00:00:31.866
<v Nuri>There’s an empty shell here. Which shell will the crab carry away?

00:00:35.666 --> 00:00:39.995
<v Nuri>The big one! The crab has moved in. Can you spot the little shell it left behind?

00:00:43.145 --> 00:00:48.834
<v Nuri>A shadow crossed the sand. Look up! A gull is spreading its wings.

00:00:51.984 --> 00:00:57.673
<v Nuri>Let’s leave the shells for the crabs. We thank Allah for creating the animals by the sea.
